I did all that work.

12
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:36,280
It's done.

13
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:43,580
Now I just need to unpack a couple last things and hang up some stuff on the walls and stuff, and then I'm pretty much done.

14
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:46,860
Cheers.

15
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:53,060
Would you look at that.

16
