I shit you not, I have... It looks like a studio now.

19
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:11,040
There's like, uh... What do you call it?

20
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:15,160
Sound absorbing or like echo reducing panels on the walls?

21
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:15,920
It looks fancy.

22
