I'm excited.

26
00:02:27,990 --> 00:02:29,410
Episode 50.

27
00:02:30,650 --> 00:02:33,870
I do not remember which episode I ended first season on.

28
00:02:33,950 --> 00:02:34,670
Do you guys remember?

29
00:02:37,330 --> 00:02:40,870
Was 50 the last episode, or was it 51 or something?

30
