Well, guys, today's the last episode of season two.

33
00:02:52,820 --> 00:02:57,280
Except this episode is gonna last hundreds of hours, and we're gonna split it up into sub-episodes.

34
00:03:07,780 --> 00:03:11,280
Today is the last day of the rest.

35
00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:13,880
No, wait, today is the first day of the rest.

36
00:03:14,060 --> 00:03:14,520
I can't.

37
00:03:14,660 --> 00:03:15,460
No, I give up.

38
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,500
Let's just, you know, transition over here.

39
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:21,660
Let's just forget I tried to say something clever just now.

40
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,120
It says Minecraft.

41
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:24,900
Look at that.

42
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,120
If you think about it, it's kind of silly that it does that.

43
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:34,540
Someone buys Minecraft, they log into the game.

44
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:37,860
You know, the logo is there, and then it also says, Minecraft, flashing.

45
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:40,000
Like, hey, you're playing the game.

46
00:03:41,420 --> 00:03:41,820
What?

47
