What was that sound?

345
00:23:07,850 --> 00:23:09,050
Was that just the music?

346
00:23:09,210 --> 00:23:09,990
It sounded scary.

347
00:23:11,910 --> 00:23:13,010
Probably just the music.

348
00:23:18,830 --> 00:23:21,110
Oh, there's another track playing at the same time.

349
00:23:22,550 --> 00:23:23,890
Uh, drops?

350
00:23:24,110 --> 00:23:24,550
Yeah.

351
00:23:25,210 --> 00:23:25,970
End rod in here.

352
00:23:26,970 --> 00:23:27,690
Diamonds here.

353
00:23:27,990 --> 00:23:29,070
That was a nice song.

354
00:23:29,310 --> 00:23:30,130
I like that one.

355
00:23:30,590 --> 00:23:31,730
Look how much iron I have!

356
00:23:31,790 --> 00:23:32,470
Holy shit!

357
00:23:34,430 --> 00:23:34,910
Damn!

358
00:23:36,310 --> 00:23:39,830
Yo, I could make, uh... I could make that thingy.

359
00:23:40,330 --> 00:23:41,050
The pyramid.

360
00:23:43,710 --> 00:23:44,190
Yo!

361
00:23:45,640 --> 00:23:55,140
We should make some kind of monument in the city with that pyramid on top to make it look like it belongs there, so it's not just out of the blue.

362
00:23:56,300 --> 00:23:57,080
