I don't want to call it buildings.

369
00:24:14,010 --> 00:24:15,830
Maybe constructions that the Aztecs did.

370
00:24:15,970 --> 00:24:20,070
You know, where they had stairs up those... Well, I guess they were kind of pyramids they had.

371
00:24:20,590 --> 00:24:23,650
But not in the way of... like the Egyptians.

372
00:24:23,930 --> 00:24:24,370
You know what I mean.

373
00:24:25,810 --> 00:24:26,810
Something like that, at least.

374
00:24:26,930 --> 00:24:28,650
Something a little ethereal.

375
00:24:29,270 --> 00:24:29,970
In nature.

376
00:24:30,750 --> 00:24:31,030
Okay.

377
00:24:31,950 --> 00:24:32,750
Level 31.

378
00:24:33,010 --> 00:24:35,190
Can we somehow get to 33 right now?

379
00:24:35,970 --> 00:24:36,830
I don't think so.

380
00:24:36,950 --> 00:24:38,110
Even with all the cooking we're doing.

381
00:24:39,050 --> 00:24:40,990
Actually, we're not doing that much cooking, but...

382
00:24:41,040 --> 00:24:42,240
Let's start cooking some.

383
