I also wonder how much coal I would need to cook one stack of cobblestone.

389
00:25:11,700 --> 00:25:13,160
Let's see if 16 was enough.

390
00:25:16,710 --> 00:25:22,390
It wouldn't surprise me if it's like 16 or 8 or 32, you know, one of those numbers.

391
00:25:22,930 --> 00:25:23,750
There we go.

392
00:25:24,070 --> 00:25:24,790
Everyone is cooking.

393
