398
00:25:38,850 --> 00:25:42,430
Why would I get fire enchant on my sword?

399
00:25:43,430 --> 00:25:46,990
When I can kill cows and get experience for cooking it afterwards.

400
00:25:47,930 --> 00:25:51,090
Obviously, I don't get the satisfaction of getting the food immediately.

401
00:25:51,890 --> 00:25:54,950
It's not fast food anymore, you know, there's a bit of a delivery on that.

402
00:25:55,870 --> 00:25:59,210
But still, you could get more out of it.

403
00:26:04,620 --> 00:26:08,260
But it is nice to not have to cook it later, I guess.

404
00:26:08,820 --> 00:26:09,780
It's a trade-off.

405
