Chorus fruit.

406
00:26:14,100 --> 00:26:16,040
Can I use that in something over here?

407
00:26:22,700 --> 00:26:24,280
I want to make a chorus fruitcake.

408
00:26:28,980 --> 00:26:30,140
Okay, the rest looks good.

409
00:26:30,320 --> 00:26:32,920
This is my standard setup for exploring.

410
00:26:35,220 --> 00:26:37,580
Kind of want to put a sign over there next to that entrance.

411
00:26:37,820 --> 00:26:38,800
Oh, also, it's night.

412
00:26:38,940 --> 00:26:39,360
Let's go to bed.

413
00:26:48,740 --> 00:26:49,220
Okay.

414
00:26:49,220 --> 00:26:50,100
I need food.

415
00:26:50,820 --> 00:26:52,060
I need food right now.

416
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:56,760
I don't really have any good foods.

417
00:26:57,040 --> 00:26:57,260
Shit.

418
00:26:58,200 --> 00:27:00,600
