419
00:27:03,160 --> 00:27:04,660
Cows want...

420
00:27:07,960 --> 00:27:09,240
Which I have over here.

421
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:12,580
Yes, I do.

422
00:27:13,700 --> 00:27:14,640
Even have some beef.

423
00:27:15,840 --> 00:27:17,260
I don't have beef with the cows.

424
00:27:17,660 --> 00:27:18,380
You know what I mean.

425
00:27:19,060 --> 00:27:19,800
Here, eat.

426
00:27:21,940 --> 00:27:24,000
Maybe I gather everyone again.

427
