Yeah, actually.

428
00:27:26,780 --> 00:27:28,100
Why are they down here?

429
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:28,820
What's happening?

430
00:27:28,980 --> 00:27:31,340
What's so exciting about that part of the wall?

431
00:27:32,640 --> 00:27:33,680
Come here, everybody.

432
00:27:34,580 --> 00:27:35,340
Come here.

433
00:27:36,360 --> 00:27:37,520
Yeah, you want wheat?

434
00:27:38,160 --> 00:27:39,060
Follow me.

435
00:27:39,240 --> 00:27:40,040
I'm your dealer.

436
00:27:41,040 --> 00:27:42,040
Here's my number.

437
00:27:42,340 --> 00:27:43,400
Call me anytime.

438
00:27:49,420 --> 00:27:50,340
Come on, then.

439
00:27:50,680 --> 00:27:51,080
Yes.

440
00:27:51,920 --> 00:27:52,840
Good cows.

441
00:27:54,820 --> 00:27:55,640
Oh, shit.

442
00:27:59,400 --> 00:28:00,700
Yeah, come here.

443
00:28:00,780 --> 00:28:01,420
Come here, everybody.

444
00:28:02,620 --> 00:28:03,720
I've got wheat.

445
00:28:08,440 --> 00:28:09,820
That's right, come on.

446
00:28:10,300 --> 00:28:10,940
No pushing.

447
00:28:12,260 --> 00:28:13,120
Get in line.

448
00:28:14,800 --> 00:28:16,000
Everyone gets inside.

449
00:28:16,980 --> 00:28:17,740
Come on, then.

450
00:28:20,380 --> 00:28:20,980
Get in.

451
00:28:22,740 --> 00:28:24,640
They're blocking each other from getting in.

452
00:28:25,540 --> 00:28:27,020
There we go, there we go, come on.

453
00:28:28,300 --> 00:28:30,180
Yes, good job, everybody.

454
00:28:31,100 --> 00:28:33,240
No, no, sorry, I didn't mean to push you out.

455
00:28:35,280 --> 00:28:35,880
Come on.

456
00:28:36,630 --> 00:28:37,810
I need to close that gate.

457
00:28:39,350 --> 00:28:39,790
Boom.

458
00:28:41,430 --> 00:28:44,810
Come to me, and then I'm gonna... close that.

459
00:28:45,970 --> 00:28:47,190
Kidding, you're not getting any food.

460
00:28:49,970 --> 00:28:50,830
Shit, okay.

461
