463
00:28:58,810 --> 00:29:05,190
Now the rest of the cows need to be, uh... What is the word for, you know, collecting animals like this?

464
00:29:08,230 --> 00:29:18,210
And I'm not talking about Pokemon style, I'm talking... it's like hurting... not hurting, more like... rousing them, you know?

465
00:29:18,630 --> 00:29:19,510
That's not a word.

466
00:29:19,710 --> 00:29:20,990
It is a word, but not correct.

467
00:29:22,890 --> 00:29:26,590
You know, gathering... you know what I mean.

468
00:29:27,250 --> 00:29:28,010
Get inside here!

469
00:29:29,970 --> 00:29:30,650
Everyone in!

470
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:39,280
Hey!

471
00:29:39,280 --> 00:29:40,320
No, come on!

472
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:42,760
Am I gonna have to start?

473
