Look, everyone gets food, but only if you get inside.

474
00:29:51,620 --> 00:29:52,480
Eat, eat up.

475
00:29:53,300 --> 00:29:58,720
Everyone who's outside at this very moment is going to die in a minute, because I will kill them.

476
00:29:59,460 --> 00:30:00,620
It's like musical chairs.

477
00:30:00,840 --> 00:30:01,360
You missed it.

478
00:30:01,440 --> 00:30:01,560
No!

479
00:30:04,740 --> 00:30:05,180
Close!

480
00:30:05,320 --> 00:30:05,960
Why can I close it?

481
00:30:06,560 --> 00:30:07,340
Okay, there we go.

482
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:10,740
I need to get out.

483
00:30:11,600 --> 00:30:14,340
How do I fucking... Okay, I made it.

484
00:30:14,860 --> 00:30:15,520
You die.

485
00:30:16,840 --> 00:30:19,340
Somehow this child made their way out.

486
00:30:19,500 --> 00:30:21,480
I'm sorry, but... Rules are rules.

487
00:30:22,280 --> 00:30:23,700
Doesn't matter what age you are.

488
00:30:26,340 --> 00:30:27,080
There we go.

489
00:30:27,760 --> 00:30:29,560
Everything has been fixed.

490
00:30:31,740 --> 00:30:32,660
Did I miss anyone?

491
00:30:37,180 --> 00:30:37,540
Okay.

492
00:30:37,540 --> 00:30:39,040
Let's go fix the food situation.

493
00:30:39,780 --> 00:30:40,900
