In fact, we just need a single iron ingot.

542
00:33:36,160 --> 00:33:36,900
And some wood.

543
00:33:38,800 --> 00:33:41,980
Give me a dozen wood and I can make anything happen.

544
00:33:48,960 --> 00:33:49,420
Shield.

545
00:33:49,420 --> 00:33:50,260
There we go.

546
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:51,900
How's my armor?

547
00:33:52,340 --> 00:33:53,080
Pretty good.

548
00:33:53,280 --> 00:33:54,260
I like my armor.

549
00:33:56,080 --> 00:33:58,340
I'm already carrying wood, so we don't need to bring that.

550
00:33:59,340 --> 00:34:01,320
I will bring this one.

551
00:34:01,480 --> 00:34:02,600
Oh, do I need to bring it, though?

552
00:34:04,620 --> 00:34:05,580
I think yes.

553
00:34:05,980 --> 00:34:08,980
Because it is nice to have the ability to fly around when I need to.

554
00:34:09,820 --> 00:34:10,720
Even down there.

555
00:34:11,860 --> 00:34:12,880
Let's bring...

556
00:34:15,820 --> 00:34:16,900
Fourteen rockets.

557
00:34:18,700 --> 00:34:20,100
Oh, I had a shield here as well.

558
00:34:21,620 --> 00:34:22,680
Let's remember that.

559
00:34:25,340 --> 00:34:26,260
I need this.

560
00:34:27,920 --> 00:34:29,180
We are so back.

561
00:34:30,060 --> 00:34:31,500
Obviously I need more torches.

562
00:34:40,020 --> 00:34:41,120
It's gonna be eight.

563
00:34:42,420 --> 00:34:44,140
When this is out, it's gonna be eight.

564
00:34:45,220 --> 00:34:49,260
Because this right here is the ninth being burned right now.

565
00:34:51,900 --> 00:34:55,000
I'm gonna need to take this.

566
00:34:58,410 --> 00:34:58,910
Sorry.

567
00:34:59,990 --> 00:35:01,430
I need the coal right now.

568
00:35:01,590 --> 00:35:02,250
I need more coal.

569
00:35:03,910 --> 00:35:04,650
For sure.

570
00:35:07,130 --> 00:35:07,630
Sticks.

571
00:35:08,090 --> 00:35:08,990
And stones.

572
00:35:09,370 --> 00:35:09,850
Mindjack.

573
00:35:11,150 --> 00:35:14,430
So I need to do... torches.

574
00:35:15,470 --> 00:35:16,270
There we go.

575
00:35:16,310 --> 00:35:17,890
Just in case we find dark areas, you know.

576
00:35:19,870 --> 00:35:20,370
Good!

577
00:35:21,070 --> 00:35:22,470
Two beds is an overkill.

578
00:35:27,290 --> 00:35:27,730
Wonderful.

579
00:35:27,730 --> 00:35:28,470
We are ready.

580
00:35:30,110 --> 00:35:31,030
Oh, right, food.

581
00:35:31,270 --> 00:35:33,410
Food situation, let's just bring some other food.

582
00:35:35,190 --> 00:35:38,670
Like baked potatoes is probably good enough for what I'm about to do.

583
00:35:40,930 --> 00:35:42,850
How do I make my own golden apples?

584
00:35:44,350 --> 00:35:45,790
I am able to do that, right?

585
00:35:47,650 --> 00:35:48,490
Yes, I am.

586
00:35:50,050 --> 00:35:53,790
So I'm gonna need gold and a lot of it.

587
00:35:55,380 --> 00:35:55,900
Boom.

588
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:58,060
It's apple time.

589
00:36:00,800 --> 00:36:02,940
Now this is pot raising.

590
00:36:03,720 --> 00:36:04,620
Look at that.

591
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:06,000
43 golden apples.

592
00:36:06,700 --> 00:36:07,520
Just like that.

593
00:36:07,980 --> 00:36:09,400
They're gonna go straight into my tummy.

594
00:36:10,120 --> 00:36:11,300
Oh, not all of them.

595
00:36:11,420 --> 00:36:17,100
We're gonna save some for finding villagers that are zombified or whatever, right?

596
00:36:18,720 --> 00:36:20,500
So we're not gonna need potatoes right now.

597
00:36:20,600 --> 00:36:22,280
Let's leave most of these at home.

598
00:36:24,290 --> 00:36:26,210
I think having 10 here is a good amount.

599
00:36:27,850 --> 00:36:28,250
Yeah.

600
00:36:29,610 --> 00:36:31,150
Also, why is this in the food basket?

601
00:36:36,490 --> 00:36:44,110
I like this bundle here being essentials that we always want to bring that is not just one-off, but maybe like 10, 20.

602
00:36:45,510 --> 00:36:47,350
Such as, you know, obsidian and wood.

603
00:36:48,050 --> 00:36:51,130
We always want to bring bones for dogs.

604
00:36:53,570 --> 00:36:54,290
There we go.

605
00:36:59,620 --> 00:37:00,060
Okay.

606
00:37:00,060 --> 00:37:00,860
I think we're ready.

607
00:37:01,540 --> 00:37:03,880
Put this on, and let's go to town.

608
00:37:04,820 --> 00:37:06,180
Aw, we're flying, dude!

609
00:37:06,400 --> 00:37:07,960
We're in the V3 right now.

610
00:37:08,340 --> 00:37:09,080
On Penemunde.

611
00:37:11,260 --> 00:37:12,140
Can you feel it?

612
00:37:14,160 --> 00:37:16,320
Even though it's probably gonna be cramped inside one of those.

613
00:37:18,620 --> 00:37:19,060
Whoop!

614
00:37:21,160 --> 00:37:22,060
Ah, made it.

615
00:37:22,820 --> 00:37:24,280
Now I wanna switch back.

616
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:25,040
Switch back.

617
00:37:27,590 --> 00:37:28,270
And down.

618
00:37:29,810 --> 00:37:30,250
Shit.

619
00:37:33,830 --> 00:37:34,890
My nose is itchy.

620
00:37:37,570 --> 00:37:38,210
There we go.

621
00:37:41,190 --> 00:37:42,370
Now, are you ready?

622
00:37:42,450 --> 00:37:44,090
I'm gonna find the guy in record time.

623
00:37:44,250 --> 00:37:46,930
The guy will be found in... 10 minutes.

624
00:37:47,250 --> 00:37:47,350
No!

625
00:37:48,150 --> 00:37:49,010
8 minutes.

626
00:37:51,990 --> 00:37:53,610
Oh shit, wait, that's the wrong way.

627
00:37:53,990 --> 00:37:55,110
Wait, am I the right spot?

628
00:38:02,540 --> 00:38:03,440
I think so.

629
00:38:03,700 --> 00:38:04,840
He has to be here.

630
00:38:06,120 --> 00:38:07,640
Because he wasn't in the other spot.

631
00:38:09,840 --> 00:38:10,940
This looks promising.

632
00:38:16,580 --> 00:38:17,100
Okay.

633
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:18,640
Oh, yeah, actually.

634
00:38:22,540 --> 00:38:23,480
We need to listen.

635
00:38:32,840 --> 00:38:33,900
Yeah, yeah!

636
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:36,400
See, I knew it!

637
00:38:37,220 --> 00:38:38,120
Fuck, I'm good!

638
00:38:38,360 --> 00:38:40,180
I told you he was in this mine.

639
00:38:40,580 --> 00:38:41,860
Straight north of the village.

640
00:38:42,040 --> 00:38:43,140
Didn't I say so last time?

641
00:38:43,260 --> 00:38:44,040
I said so.

642
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:45,600
Alright, dude.

643
00:38:46,280 --> 00:38:46,800
I'm good.

644
00:38:47,120 --> 00:38:49,820
Oh, I should have brought two books.

645
00:38:50,680 --> 00:38:51,920
So I could have done it twice.

646
00:38:53,420 --> 00:38:54,420
Oh, I brought three.

647
00:38:54,540 --> 00:38:55,200
Never mind, I'm good.

648
00:38:56,560 --> 00:38:57,440
I'm good, I'm good.

649
00:38:59,080 --> 00:39:00,320
Thank you very much.

650
00:39:00,830 --> 00:39:03,210
Thank you very much, and I'll see you later.

651
00:39:05,670 --> 00:39:07,770
In fact, I need to make a little home for you down here.

652
00:39:10,670 --> 00:39:12,190
What do I have to work with here?

653
00:39:13,510 --> 00:39:14,950
I'll be back for you later, okay?

654
00:39:15,110 --> 00:39:16,430
We're gonna make a home for you down here.

655
00:39:16,510 --> 00:39:17,690
I know you like to be a hermit.

656
00:39:18,390 --> 00:39:20,970
Apparently you can't vibe very well with the rest of the village.

657
00:39:21,570 --> 00:39:22,170
That's okay.

658
00:39:23,790 --> 00:39:24,810
You get to stay here.

659
00:39:34,120 --> 00:39:36,580
Let's just double check we didn't miss any dark spots here.

660
00:39:38,280 --> 00:39:39,160
Oh, I did.

661
00:39:39,560 --> 00:39:39,960
Kinda.

662
00:39:40,920 --> 00:39:41,580
Yo, look at that!

663
00:39:41,740 --> 00:39:42,260
It's so dark!

664
00:39:44,760 --> 00:39:46,200
How the hell did I miss this?

665
00:39:48,300 --> 00:39:49,640
It's right next to the village.

666
00:39:52,260 --> 00:39:55,340
That is actually a disaster for the Orphan Crusher.

667
00:39:56,540 --> 00:39:57,460
Not anymore, though.

668
00:39:57,540 --> 00:39:58,060
I fixed it.

669
00:40:02,490 --> 00:40:03,510
This is all lit.

670
00:40:03,770 --> 00:40:03,970
Good.

671
00:40:13,050 --> 00:40:14,130
Listen for enemies.

672
00:40:31,200 --> 00:40:32,140
Not hearing anything.

673
00:40:36,040 --> 00:40:42,600
These mines here, or tunnels, are so... scattered, right?

674
00:40:42,780 --> 00:40:44,500
That could be little pockets of it.

675
00:40:45,560 --> 00:40:47,480
But the only way to get to it would be to dig.

676
00:40:49,080 --> 00:40:51,220
So we gotta be wary of that.

677
00:40:53,720 --> 00:40:55,120
I don't have any ascension blocks?

678
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:56,100
Oh my god.

679
00:41:00,740 --> 00:41:02,840
Standard setup for exploring has failed me.

680
00:41:07,340 --> 00:41:09,540
Wait, what am I... Wait, where am I?

681
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:13,120
Why did I go up there?

682
00:41:15,080 --> 00:41:16,000
That was a dead end.

683
00:41:21,500 --> 00:41:22,440
Let me try and dig here.

684
00:41:22,620 --> 00:41:23,220
I have a feeling.

685
00:41:26,700 --> 00:41:27,680
Oh, nice.

686
00:41:29,200 --> 00:41:31,040
Yeah, I'll take that.

687
00:41:32,180 --> 00:41:33,580
Any day of the week.

688
00:41:35,520 --> 00:41:36,800
Specifically Saturday, though.

689
00:41:50,960 --> 00:41:51,600
Nice.

690
00:41:56,010 --> 00:41:56,890
Let's go this way.

691
00:41:57,290 --> 00:41:58,070
I have a feeling.

692
00:42:03,530 --> 00:42:06,930
Now, I think actually it is a great idea to make these random digs like this.

693
00:42:08,210 --> 00:42:09,350
In like a certain direction.

694
00:42:09,590 --> 00:42:11,290
Get to the end and then sort of take a probe.

695
00:42:11,650 --> 00:42:12,270
And listen.

696
00:42:13,710 --> 00:42:14,470
I hear nothing.

697
00:42:14,910 --> 00:42:16,770
So then we take another probe somewhere else.

698
00:42:20,920 --> 00:42:21,840
Maybe this direction.

699
00:42:25,060 --> 00:42:25,860
I'll take this.

700
00:42:25,960 --> 00:42:27,160
This is a nice ascension block.

701
00:42:33,520 --> 00:42:34,680
Let's probe this direction.

702
00:42:45,450 --> 00:42:46,210
Granite!

703
00:42:46,490 --> 00:42:47,610
That means enemies.

704
00:42:50,250 --> 00:42:51,290
They're nearby.

705
00:43:00,710 --> 00:43:02,070
Okay, there's nothing here.

706
00:43:11,510 --> 00:43:13,250
Oh, oh, oh, okay, never mind.

707
00:43:15,610 --> 00:43:17,870
Like, sometimes I gotta probe upwards.

708
00:43:19,470 --> 00:43:22,130
Because these mines can be on different levels, right?

709
00:43:23,670 --> 00:43:24,830
Let's probe this direction.

710
00:43:29,590 --> 00:43:29,990
Aha!

711
00:43:30,470 --> 00:43:31,390
We've already been here.

712
00:43:32,130 --> 00:43:33,910
But look, I was kinda right.

713
00:43:35,750 --> 00:43:36,790
Where the hell am I?

714
00:43:40,560 --> 00:43:41,520
Oh.

715
00:43:41,520 --> 00:43:42,480
Hello.

716
00:43:43,260 --> 00:43:44,980
Got a little spider spawner.

717
00:43:47,480 --> 00:43:49,760
That could have been a creeper spawner.

718
00:43:53,380 --> 00:43:54,340
Shit.

719
00:43:55,400 --> 00:43:57,640
Man, I need a compass.

720
00:44:01,860 --> 00:44:02,720
You know what?

721
00:44:02,940 --> 00:44:06,380
I was shitting on the compass early on, but... Oh, here we go.

722
00:44:08,080 --> 00:44:11,580
But I really think a compass could be super useful inside the caves.

723
00:44:15,820 --> 00:44:16,620
Let's go here.

724
00:44:18,240 --> 00:44:18,760
Ah!

725
00:44:19,740 --> 00:44:20,040
Oh.

726
00:44:22,240 --> 00:44:22,760
Here.

727
00:44:27,220 --> 00:44:28,500
Okay, nothing that way.

728
00:44:31,460 --> 00:44:33,140
That was my probe from before.

729
00:44:34,840 --> 00:44:36,260
I think we're done here.

730
00:44:36,720 --> 00:44:38,500
I don't see any other dark spots.

731
00:44:41,780 --> 00:44:42,440
Then again.

732
00:44:42,620 --> 00:44:43,840
Oh, that was my earlier probe.

733
00:44:46,300 --> 00:44:47,400
What was that just now?

734
00:44:49,100 --> 00:44:50,100
You heard that sound?

735
00:44:51,000 --> 00:44:51,480
Plop.

736
00:45:01,900 --> 00:45:02,780
Thank you.

737
00:45:07,040 --> 00:45:08,700
Oh yeah, I need this so bad.

738
00:45:10,120 --> 00:45:11,440
Give me coal!

739
00:45:15,700 --> 00:45:16,420
Let's go.

740
00:45:21,800 --> 00:45:22,620
Very good.

741
00:45:24,160 --> 00:45:27,160
Actually, I need to do that.

742
00:45:27,980 --> 00:45:29,280
Just to be safe.

743
00:45:32,090 --> 00:45:33,630
Did I do a probe here?

744
00:45:41,010 --> 00:45:47,750
Not hearing anything, but let's just... Maybe the probe needs to be elevated?

745
00:45:48,990 --> 00:45:49,630
Ah!

746
00:45:50,010 --> 00:45:51,070
Probe successful!

747
00:45:53,550 --> 00:45:54,190
Woohoo!

748
00:45:54,730 --> 00:45:55,730
Look at that!

749
00:45:59,950 --> 00:46:01,670
That's what I'm talking about, baby!

750
00:46:02,610 --> 00:46:04,330
Found a little... Wait, where am I actually?

751
00:46:05,750 --> 00:46:06,890
Are those torches?

752
00:46:07,450 --> 00:46:08,050
No.

753
00:46:11,870 --> 00:46:12,950
Very nice.

754
00:46:15,030 --> 00:46:16,470
And more coal as well.

755
00:46:16,570 --> 00:46:19,910
I'm being rewarded for my probing.

756
00:46:21,010 --> 00:46:22,110
Love probing.

757
00:46:30,070 --> 00:46:33,090
It is really painful, though, how slow it is to mine this coal.

758
00:46:35,130 --> 00:46:36,970
Good news, we're almost 33.

759
00:46:38,370 --> 00:46:40,130
So those slow days are over soon.

760
00:46:41,810 --> 00:46:43,430
In fact, I'm gonna say it right now.

761
00:46:43,570 --> 00:46:45,850
Today I will make a netherite pickaxe.

762
00:46:46,110 --> 00:46:47,190
It's gonna happen today.

763
00:46:48,530 --> 00:46:49,950
You can take that to the bank.

764
00:47:03,100 --> 00:47:06,840
So this lava right here is lighting up everything for me, so I don't need to worry about that.

765
00:47:08,600 --> 00:47:09,660
Actually, I'll take some gold.

766
00:47:10,600 --> 00:47:11,720
Am I hearing enemies?

767
00:47:17,200 --> 00:47:18,520
I mean, it wouldn't be a surprise, I guess.

768
00:47:18,640 --> 00:47:19,280
It's dark down here.

769
00:47:24,480 --> 00:47:26,340
Oh my god, look at this drop!

770
00:47:30,520 --> 00:47:31,980
That's like an insane drop.

771
00:47:36,180 --> 00:47:36,780
Oh.

772
00:47:37,640 --> 00:47:42,340
Tell me, okay, does this not look like fucking diorite?

773
00:47:46,980 --> 00:47:53,480
Okay, so I guess down here the lighting is different, but... I was so confused just now.

774
00:47:54,320 --> 00:47:55,340
I'm not joking.

775
00:47:56,720 --> 00:48:03,180
Like, there's a reason why it's so hard to see, because the texture is, like, almost identical to cobblestone.

776
00:48:03,880 --> 00:48:05,720
Especially under these lighting circumstances.

777
00:48:09,660 --> 00:48:14,240
And yeah, you can make fun of it and all that, but... I will die on that hill.

778
00:48:17,180 --> 00:48:18,420
Give me that diamond, please.

779
00:48:26,620 --> 00:48:28,700
Okay, I found a sprawling network of caves here.

780
00:48:29,040 --> 00:48:29,940
Holy sh...

781
00:48:33,830 --> 00:48:34,830
How dare you?

782
00:48:35,590 --> 00:48:36,030
Huh?

783
00:48:37,730 --> 00:48:40,930
Bro, what if I try to give this guy a golden apple?

784
00:48:41,970 --> 00:48:43,170
Why didn't I do that, Justin?

785
00:48:43,370 --> 00:48:44,790
Oh, I could have tried that, I guess.

786
00:48:45,270 --> 00:48:46,570
Maybe something else will happen.

787
00:48:47,990 --> 00:48:50,430
Or what if I use a, um...

788
00:48:55,580 --> 00:48:56,940
Charged tripod on him.

789
00:48:57,960 --> 00:49:01,260
I wonder what will happen to him in that case.

790
00:49:01,600 --> 00:49:02,660
I heard an enemy here.

791
00:49:04,060 --> 00:49:04,940
Let's keep that in mind.

792
00:49:11,620 --> 00:49:13,040
Here we don't even need to probe.

793
00:49:13,220 --> 00:49:14,940
The cape was already a probe in itself.

794
00:49:16,620 --> 00:49:21,980
And let's not forget, I went into a little area on my way down the shaft.

795
00:49:22,580 --> 00:49:25,160
So I gotta go back and continue down the shaft.

796
00:49:28,040 --> 00:49:29,500
The shaft needs to be worked.

797
00:49:33,080 --> 00:49:33,920
I'm sorry.

798
00:49:34,800 --> 00:49:35,900
Put this in here.

799
00:49:37,120 --> 00:49:38,540
Bones, all of them go in.

800
00:49:39,940 --> 00:49:41,840
Coal, not sure.

801
00:49:41,940 --> 00:49:43,420
One book can go in, I guess.

802
00:49:43,580 --> 00:49:44,180
Yeah, why not.

803
00:49:45,100 --> 00:49:45,540
Elytra.

804
00:49:49,380 --> 00:49:51,160
Yeah, we got enemies.

805
00:49:52,560 --> 00:49:54,640
I actually love hearing the enemies now.

806
00:49:56,820 --> 00:49:58,020
Hold on, my ear is itchy.

807
00:50:00,200 --> 00:50:00,960
My god.

808
00:50:03,740 --> 00:50:05,260
Why am I so itchy today?

809
00:50:09,580 --> 00:50:10,760
Wait, where's everybody?

810
00:50:11,720 --> 00:50:13,400
Oh, there you are!

811
00:50:15,360 --> 00:50:16,340
Look at you!

812
00:50:23,800 --> 00:50:24,400
Oh!

813
00:50:26,780 --> 00:50:28,660
Fucking orphan crusher saboteurs.

814
00:50:34,410 --> 00:50:36,190
Oh my, I'm gonna get lost on here for sure.

815
00:50:36,970 --> 00:50:40,190
I've taken so many different winding paths now, it's not good.

816
00:50:44,370 --> 00:50:45,570
I came from here, right?

817
00:50:46,150 --> 00:50:46,590
Yeah.

818
00:50:46,950 --> 00:50:48,690
So let's do a sign.

819
00:50:52,610 --> 00:50:53,950
Came from here.

820
00:50:55,070 --> 00:50:56,970
Go up the shaft.

821
00:50:58,030 --> 00:51:00,450
No, go back to shaft.

822
00:51:01,430 --> 00:51:02,150
Shaft.

823
