If I forget the shulker box, you know, it's... that means I'm gonna forget my... my netherite, too.

1895
01:55:11,740 --> 01:55:13,160
Actually, I'm just gonna use all my TNT.

1896
01:55:13,280 --> 01:55:13,560
Why not?

1897
01:55:13,700 --> 01:55:14,220
Since I'm here.

1898
01:55:15,420 --> 01:55:19,220
Let's just, uh... Let's try to use all of it and see how it feels.

1899
01:55:20,420 --> 01:55:21,040
Let's do that.

1900
01:55:24,420 --> 01:55:25,340
Let's try and be fast.

1901
01:55:28,940 --> 01:55:30,300
That's a big-ass explosion.

1902
01:55:30,820 --> 01:55:33,120
Now we gotta go kinda deep now.

1903
01:55:33,760 --> 01:55:35,420
So here, boom, shoot it.

1904
01:55:36,140 --> 01:55:36,700
Go.

1905
01:55:37,060 --> 01:55:38,700
Maybe we go here in the meantime.

1906
01:55:41,220 --> 01:55:42,100
Save time.

1907
01:55:42,340 --> 01:55:42,920
Optimization.

1908
01:55:44,240 --> 01:55:45,300
Go over here now.

1909
01:55:48,740 --> 01:55:49,540
Shoot it.

1910
01:55:50,800 --> 01:55:51,400
Explore.

1911
01:55:55,430 --> 01:55:56,330
It's kind of cool.

1912
01:55:56,630 --> 01:55:57,610
It's kind of cool, not gonna lie.

1913
01:55:57,850 --> 01:55:59,310
I mean, blowing shit up is fun.

1914
01:56:01,430 --> 01:56:02,110
Oh god!

1915
01:56:04,910 --> 01:56:07,070
Imagine if the lava activated it!

1916
01:56:08,070 --> 01:56:08,910
My goodness!

1917
01:56:10,230 --> 01:56:11,550
Not what I needed to do.

1918
01:56:16,250 --> 01:56:19,290
I was ready to die in that moment just now, I tell you.

1919
01:56:26,030 --> 01:56:29,190
The bad news, I think, and let me actually confirm this.

1920
01:56:35,270 --> 01:56:36,110
Oh, fuck.

1921
01:56:41,190 --> 01:56:42,410
Never mind!

1922
01:56:43,150 --> 01:56:45,130
It does give me experience!

1923
01:56:45,850 --> 01:56:49,010
I was like, it's gonna waste the... the quartz.

1924
01:56:49,530 --> 01:56:51,190
But it's actually not.

1925
01:56:53,290 --> 01:56:53,970
Okay.

1926
01:57:02,950 --> 01:57:04,010
Uh, okay.

1927
01:57:05,010 --> 01:57:07,810
Is it me or does it have a harder time destroying this?

1928
01:57:09,510 --> 01:57:11,510
It's like this is more resistant to explosion.

1929
01:57:13,290 --> 01:57:14,350
I think I'm right there.

1930
01:57:21,540 --> 01:57:22,460
I came from here.

1931
01:57:25,160 --> 01:57:27,140
Let's go up here to where we took the left turn.

1932
01:57:28,360 --> 01:57:29,500
I went down here.

1933
01:57:29,860 --> 01:57:31,440
This is where I found the first one.

1934
01:57:31,940 --> 01:57:33,000
Let's go like this now.

1935
01:57:42,820 --> 01:57:47,060
I mean... Okay, I think it is faster, actually.

1936
01:57:50,300 --> 01:57:56,600
The only problem is... TNTs stack, but they're expensive to make.

1937
01:57:57,140 --> 01:57:58,280
Bets don't stack.

1938
01:57:59,540 --> 01:58:01,600
So you're very limited in that respect.

1939
01:58:03,580 --> 01:58:07,980
You know, you can't... I have no buff!

1940
01:58:09,420 --> 01:58:11,440
No, I don't have it, I don't have it.

1941
01:58:11,660 --> 01:58:13,180
Block, block, block, block, block, block, block, block.

1942
01:58:16,090 --> 01:58:19,010
I could have sworn I had the buff for longer, but okay.

1943
01:58:20,790 --> 01:58:21,830
I'm gonna take this.

1944
01:58:23,290 --> 01:58:24,250
Sweet experience.

1945
01:58:30,850 --> 01:58:31,390
Nice.

1946
01:58:41,070 --> 01:58:41,770
Very good.

1947
01:58:42,890 --> 01:58:44,070
Now I go this way.

1948
01:58:46,310 --> 01:58:51,010
Well, I ran out of... TNT.

1949
01:58:51,430 --> 01:58:52,490
But I have a bed left.

1950
01:58:58,590 --> 01:58:59,770
I can't reach from here, can I?

1951
01:59:05,710 --> 01:59:07,210
Fuck me, dude.

1952
01:59:07,690 --> 01:59:09,330
That just scared... I thought I was dead.

1953
01:59:11,430 --> 01:59:11,830
Wow.

1954
01:59:13,350 --> 01:59:15,090
I thought for sure I was out of range there.

1955
01:59:15,270 --> 01:59:16,890
That's why I got so startled by that.

1956
01:59:18,650 --> 01:59:20,470
Interestingly, this also sets things on fire.

1957
01:59:20,790 --> 01:59:21,990
The TNT doesn't.

1958
01:59:23,010 --> 01:59:23,830
Why is that?

1959
01:59:29,270 --> 01:59:30,410
Weird.

1960
01:59:35,490 --> 01:59:39,290
Yeah, it's wildly inefficient doing it like this.

1961
01:59:39,490 --> 01:59:40,150
But it's fun.

1962
01:59:40,670 --> 01:59:42,150
Can't deny the fun factor.

1963
01:59:43,690 --> 01:59:44,890
Let's get rid of all this.

1964
01:59:47,330 --> 01:59:50,330
Now, if I had like... I don't know.

1965
01:59:50,610 --> 01:59:51,970
Two stacks of TNT.

1966
01:59:52,690 --> 01:59:54,290
Then it's a different story, right?

1967
01:59:55,450 --> 01:59:56,670
Then I could go nuts.

1968
02:00:00,010 --> 02:00:00,550
Lights.

1969
02:00:02,240 --> 02:00:06,520
I'm just gonna do my tried and proven method here.

1970
02:00:08,320 --> 02:00:09,380
Time tested.

1971
02:00:24,020 --> 02:00:26,500
Man, it's been a while since I've been swimming in the inexperience.

1972
02:00:26,620 --> 02:00:27,300
This feels good again.

1973
02:00:28,100 --> 02:00:28,640
Oh, god.

1974
02:00:29,400 --> 02:00:29,760
Oh!

1975
02:00:30,900 --> 02:00:32,040
Oh, we have a problem.

1976
02:00:32,320 --> 02:00:33,200
Oh, no.

1977
02:00:34,660 --> 02:00:35,740
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

1978
02:00:35,800 --> 02:00:36,220
What do I do?

1979
02:00:38,180 --> 02:00:39,920
The potion is in the box!

1980
02:00:44,980 --> 02:00:45,940
Rescue mission, engage.

1981
02:00:49,180 --> 02:00:49,540
Okay.

1982
02:00:54,170 --> 02:00:55,890
Are you kidding me?

1983
02:00:58,250 --> 02:01:02,090
Block it.

1984
02:01:05,050 --> 02:01:07,310
Oh, no.

1985
02:01:08,110 --> 02:01:09,470
Oh, no.

1986
02:01:13,580 --> 02:01:16,820
How am I gonna recover from this?

1987
02:01:19,500 --> 02:01:20,980
Oh no, I'm burning now.

1988
02:01:22,800 --> 02:01:23,280
Stop!

1989
02:01:25,460 --> 02:01:26,100
It's over.

1990
02:01:26,500 --> 02:01:27,500
That box is gone.

1991
02:01:36,180 --> 02:01:37,720
I have no idea where that box is.

1992
02:01:45,270 --> 02:01:46,570
What was in that box anyway?

1993
02:01:47,190 --> 02:01:49,790
We had one potion and the rest was just bullshit, right?

1994
02:01:49,890 --> 02:01:51,230
There was nothing really valuable in there.

1995
02:01:51,370 --> 02:01:51,790
Yeah, fuck it.

1996
02:01:52,310 --> 02:01:52,830
Doesn't matter.

1997
02:01:54,430 --> 02:01:55,030
It's okay.

1998
02:01:57,790 --> 02:01:59,270
The box is useless.

1999
02:02:07,410 --> 02:02:10,310
Now... This way.

2000
02:02:12,010 --> 02:02:13,590
Just go in every direction here.

2001
02:02:25,500 --> 02:02:26,820
Back in there.

2002
02:02:41,910 --> 02:02:43,370
I mean, I already got what I came for.

2003
02:02:43,510 --> 02:02:44,570
Maybe it's time to dip out.

2004
02:02:46,410 --> 02:02:47,650
Ah, we gotta find one more.

2005
02:02:49,230 --> 02:02:49,630
Yay!

2006
02:02:53,010 --> 02:02:53,410
See?

2007
02:02:54,210 --> 02:02:56,110
Never wanna quit gambling.

2008
02:02:56,390 --> 02:02:59,210
You wanna do it because you're right in front of it.

2009
02:02:59,310 --> 02:03:00,210
You know that comic?

2010
02:03:01,050 --> 02:03:05,210
The guy who mines and stops right in front of the motherlode?

2011
02:03:05,770 --> 02:03:06,310
You know?

2012
02:03:07,590 --> 02:03:09,310
That was me right there, literally.

2013
02:03:10,040 --> 02:03:12,720
I was considering quitting, and then I didn't.

2014
02:03:13,160 --> 02:03:14,200
And I got rewarded.

2015
02:03:22,880 --> 02:03:23,920
Okay, I hate that.

2016
02:03:24,700 --> 02:03:26,020
You know what, let's do this again.

2017
02:03:26,420 --> 02:03:27,420
We're gonna go like this.

2018
02:03:29,520 --> 02:03:32,440
And then here, and then one, two... Then we dig like this.

2019
02:03:34,240 --> 02:03:36,080
Yeah, back and forth like that, like Snake.

2020
02:03:37,620 --> 02:03:38,260
The game.

2021
02:03:50,910 --> 02:03:51,930
I don't care about the quartz.

2022
02:03:52,110 --> 02:03:52,950
I have so much at home.

2023
02:03:54,190 --> 02:04:00,230
Now, I know it's a meme, you know, to say that, and then later on you're gonna need it, but I actually do have so much, I will never need more.

2024
02:04:02,150 --> 02:04:03,250
I can tell you that right now.

2025
02:04:04,890 --> 02:04:06,930
I have infinite quartz, pretty much.

2026
02:04:11,150 --> 02:04:12,030
Hey, I need you!

2027
02:04:12,890 --> 02:04:14,210
But, uh, not when I'm down here.

2028
02:04:16,050 --> 02:04:18,050
I really do need to go, uh, ghast hunting.

2029
02:04:29,700 --> 02:04:33,080
Time to make... Oh, did I leave my crafting table?

2030
02:04:33,220 --> 02:04:33,640
No, I didn't.

2031
02:04:34,200 --> 02:04:34,560
Yes.

2032
02:04:35,680 --> 02:04:36,360
Very nice.

2033
02:04:38,120 --> 02:04:39,020
Take this in there.

2034
02:04:39,180 --> 02:04:39,400
Why not?

2035
02:04:39,500 --> 02:04:40,480
No, actually, that's a bad idea.

2036
02:04:40,580 --> 02:04:40,860
Bad idea.

2037
02:04:41,780 --> 02:04:42,900
Bones, though, can go in.

2038
02:04:43,380 --> 02:04:44,280
Same as flint.

2039
02:04:45,640 --> 02:04:46,280
No thanks.

2040
02:04:49,060 --> 02:04:49,680
Rest is good.

2041
02:05:11,610 --> 02:05:12,630
Yep.

2042
02:05:13,470 --> 02:05:16,130
And that's... bad.

2043
02:05:17,130 --> 02:05:18,870
So now we're gonna go snake again.

2044
02:05:19,290 --> 02:05:19,830
Here.

2045
02:05:22,210 --> 02:05:23,230
Here.

2046
02:05:25,940 --> 02:05:31,520
And just like that, we systematically explore every inch of this.

2047
02:05:31,620 --> 02:05:32,180
Okay, that's lava.

2048
02:05:32,280 --> 02:05:32,600
That's bad.

2049
02:05:33,620 --> 02:05:34,940
Let's snake to the other side, then.

2050
02:05:36,240 --> 02:05:38,420
Also, where are my potatoes at?

2051
02:05:40,140 --> 02:05:40,580
Ah.

2052
02:05:41,480 --> 02:05:42,040
Found them.

2053
02:05:51,740 --> 02:05:52,720
Don't eat all this.

2054
02:05:58,430 --> 02:05:59,970
Oh, I did already snake that way.

2055
02:06:01,930 --> 02:06:03,010
Guess I'll snake this way.

2056
02:06:05,650 --> 02:06:06,830
Oh yes, music time!

2057
02:06:19,890 --> 02:06:21,010
This is such a vibe.

2058
02:06:22,810 --> 02:06:26,830
As soon as that music starts, it's a whole different feeling.

2059
02:06:33,170 --> 02:06:36,090
Look at me, dude!

2060
02:06:36,170 --> 02:06:36,890
I'm killing it!

2061
02:06:38,250 --> 02:06:38,770
Wow!

2062
02:06:40,810 --> 02:06:43,790
I told you we would be having only W's today.

2063
02:06:44,430 --> 02:06:45,390
No L's.

2064
02:06:52,610 --> 02:06:53,870
Oh, I ran out of torches.

2065
02:06:54,690 --> 02:06:55,370
No, I didn't.

2066
02:06:55,470 --> 02:06:55,770
Kidding.

2067
02:07:11,010 --> 02:07:11,690
That's lava.

2068
02:07:12,650 --> 02:07:13,450
Don't like that.

2069
02:07:13,910 --> 02:07:15,450
Time to snake our way out of here.

2070
02:07:23,390 --> 02:07:24,790
Almost level 30 again.

2071
02:07:34,990 --> 02:07:39,150
I think I found the mother load of... of netherite down here.

2072
02:07:40,110 --> 02:07:41,670
This is the spot to be in.

2073
02:07:46,590 --> 02:07:50,010
Ridiculous concentration of netherite just in this spot.

2074
02:07:50,710 --> 02:07:52,950
Compared to my normal statistics.

2075
02:07:54,870 --> 02:07:55,650
Okay.

2076
02:07:58,170 --> 02:08:00,330
One, two, here.

2077
02:08:11,280 --> 02:08:11,800
Nice.

2078
02:08:12,240 --> 02:08:14,100
This is such a nice bonus, finding this, too.

2079
02:08:15,640 --> 02:08:17,640
Repairs my pickaxe, gives me levels.

2080
02:08:19,460 --> 02:08:20,140
Win-win.

2081
02:08:25,080 --> 02:08:26,200
What a great feeling.

2082
02:08:34,720 --> 02:08:35,640
Lava... Oh, man.

2083
02:08:36,020 --> 02:08:37,380
Instant reaction from me there.

2084
02:08:50,390 --> 02:08:51,910
Uh, I guess we snake now.

2085
02:08:52,430 --> 02:08:54,290
Shit, that's a bad snake.

2086
02:08:55,370 --> 02:08:56,070
Bad snake!

2087
02:08:56,210 --> 02:08:56,810
Snake, snake, snake, snake!

2088
02:08:57,290 --> 02:08:58,150
God damn it.

2089
02:09:00,730 --> 02:09:01,970
Okay, this seems to be okay.

2090
02:09:06,630 --> 02:09:08,490
Look at all that flint coming out!

2091
02:09:09,390 --> 02:09:11,510
I've never seen that much flint in my life.

2092
02:09:13,230 --> 02:09:16,130
What the fuck is go- Is it because I'm in the nether?

2093
02:09:17,350 --> 02:09:19,250
Why is there so much flint popping out?

2094
02:09:22,080 --> 02:09:23,080
What is happening?

2095
02:09:33,780 --> 02:09:34,340
Wait.

2096
02:09:36,680 --> 02:09:38,480
Is it just... the enchant?

2097
02:09:40,780 --> 02:09:43,580
I feel like I... it's not just that, there's more to it.

2098
02:09:44,640 --> 02:09:46,260
Because I've had that enchant before.

2099
02:09:54,270 --> 02:09:57,110
Maybe they upped the drop rate in a patch or something.

2100
02:09:58,910 --> 02:09:59,670
Head is itchy.

2101
02:10:00,510 --> 02:10:03,170
My whole face is itchy today for some reason.

2102
02:10:04,690 --> 02:10:05,590
Can't explain it.

2103
02:10:30,680 --> 02:10:31,460
Here we go.

2104
02:10:43,720 --> 02:10:47,080
Man, maybe I actually stay in here until I have full netherite gear.

2105
02:10:55,760 --> 02:10:56,200
Again.

2106
02:10:59,870 --> 02:11:03,370
Dude, this is actually a legit way to get a lot of arrows.

2107
02:11:04,010 --> 02:11:10,590
Go to the nether, find a bunch of gravel and just punish that gravel with your shovel.

2108
02:11:11,930 --> 02:11:13,650
Really get in there and spank it.

2109
02:11:16,010 --> 02:11:17,450
And then it just pops up like that.

2110
02:11:17,590 --> 02:11:17,790
Oh god.

2111
02:11:19,050 --> 02:11:20,010
Stop burning me!

2112
02:11:20,950 --> 02:11:21,710
Fucking hell!

2113
02:11:25,250 --> 02:11:25,870
Snake time.

2114
02:11:37,920 --> 02:11:38,320
Aha!

2115
02:11:38,320 --> 02:11:41,000
I kind of have a bad feeling about this general area I'm in right now.

2116
02:11:41,140 --> 02:11:41,720
There's too much lava.

2117
02:11:47,420 --> 02:11:50,340
My finger is starting to hurt again from holding down the button.

2118
02:11:54,320 --> 02:12:02,320
I'm actually kind of disappointed with that, because I've been gaming my whole life, and you would think that my finger muscles would have prepared me for this moment.

2119
02:12:04,040 --> 02:12:05,620
Yet, it hasn't.

2120
02:12:07,940 --> 02:12:08,780
What's up with that?

2121
02:12:14,880 --> 02:12:15,280
Oh!

2122
02:12:15,780 --> 02:12:16,640
Oh, no, never mind.

2123
02:12:16,740 --> 02:12:21,200
I thought I found, uh... the block I'm looking for.

2124
02:12:21,360 --> 02:12:21,740
What's the name?

2125
02:12:21,880 --> 02:12:22,240
Netherite?

2126
02:12:25,170 --> 02:12:26,290
I want a snake again.

2127
02:12:44,110 --> 02:12:45,390
Am I close to the surface?

2128
02:12:58,300 --> 02:13:00,840
Every time I see this, my heart skips a beat.

2129
02:13:01,160 --> 02:13:04,760
Because it looks like ancient debris at first.

2130
02:13:13,200 --> 02:13:13,880
Oh god.

2131
02:13:16,520 --> 02:13:17,420
Keep it systematic.

2132
02:13:24,420 --> 02:13:29,500
I think I jinxed it before when I said this was the golden goose of locations.

2133
02:13:31,220 --> 02:13:32,460
I shouldn't have said anything.

2134
02:13:32,880 --> 02:13:33,500
Damn it.

2135
02:13:55,570 --> 02:13:58,550
Hopefully the pigs are not gonna be angry with me for everything I'm doing here.

2136
02:13:59,890 --> 02:14:01,910
I mean, they technically didn't see me commit the crime.

2137
02:14:12,050 --> 02:14:13,050
Whew, man.

2138
02:14:13,430 --> 02:14:14,670
My vision was a blur just now.

2139
02:14:21,410 --> 02:14:22,530
Maybe that's a sign.

2140
02:14:23,150 --> 02:14:26,630
What just happened there is actually really bad.

2141
02:14:29,510 --> 02:14:30,910
Yeah, that ain't good.

2142
02:14:32,170 --> 02:14:35,490
If that was lava below me, it would have been game over.

2143
02:14:43,470 --> 02:14:44,030
Shit.

2144
02:14:44,610 --> 02:14:45,330
Stop that.

2145
02:14:46,350 --> 02:14:47,250
Maybe this way.

2146
02:14:50,210 --> 02:14:50,950
Ah.

2147
02:14:53,050 --> 02:14:53,790
Oh.

2148
02:14:54,290 --> 02:14:54,970
Mmm.

2149
02:14:57,130 --> 02:14:58,550
Much lava everywhere.

2150
02:14:58,890 --> 02:14:59,430
What about here?

2151
02:15:01,150 --> 02:15:01,670
Okay.

2152
02:15:05,050 --> 02:15:06,030
Damn it.

2153
02:15:06,330 --> 02:15:06,870
Damn it.

2154
02:15:08,550 --> 02:15:09,670
Outrun the lava.

2155
02:15:15,030 --> 02:15:16,090
Oh, here we go, here we go!

2156
02:15:17,730 --> 02:15:18,090
Yeah!

2157
02:15:19,390 --> 02:15:20,090
Very nice.

2158
02:15:23,310 --> 02:15:23,670
Cool.

2159
02:15:40,870 --> 02:15:41,830
How many do I have?

2160
02:15:42,290 --> 02:15:42,710
Seven!

2161
02:15:44,290 --> 02:15:45,270
Not bad at all.

2162
02:15:55,390 --> 02:15:56,370
Can we go here now?

2163
02:16:03,750 --> 02:16:05,490
I think I'm gonna leave when I'm level 30.

2164
02:16:06,090 --> 02:16:07,210
Or 31, you know?

2165
02:16:07,630 --> 02:16:08,370
